00:11:42,260 --> 00:11:50,020
You absolutely would lose information, yes, unless you expand the coordinate space to explicitly account for those rotations.

218
00:11:50,460 --> 00:11:54,940
And Flixson does exactly this by introducing the real flag space QM.

219
00:11:55,360 --> 00:12:03,160
It's a system where that imaginary unit is entirely replaced by a literal physical quarter turn matrix, which they call JF.

220
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:05,440
Okay, a physical quarter turn matrix.

